{"4159340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Valhalla, Vikings, Ragnarok!", "steam_appid": 4159340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valhalla, Vikings, Ragnarok!</strong> It's a co-op game about a band of funny Vikings who must raid villages across all nine realms to pay off their debt to Hel and carve their path to Valhalla!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/1323ab93a040c148746241b2023eaa30.poster.avif?t=1782798511\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/1323ab93a040c148746241b2023eaa30.webm?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/1323ab93a040c148746241b2023eaa30.mp4?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GRAB THE LOOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the loot! Grab the loot! And bring it back to the ship! You need to gather as many treasures as you can before night falls — then you’d better run for safety aboard the ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/c5325089ebc426faa68024482c283696.poster.avif?t=1782798511\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/c5325089ebc426faa68024482c283696.webm?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/c5325089ebc426faa68024482c283696.mp4?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself and your friends by throwing physics-based objects at your enemies. But be careful! Valuable loot can break if you throw it too often! Still, sometimes hurling a chest at an enemy can save a Viking’s life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/ca51998c477c55d2a162e0bfe9dc35d6.poster.avif?t=1782798511\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/ca51998c477c55d2a162e0bfe9dc35d6.webm?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/ca51998c477c55d2a162e0bfe9dc35d6.mp4?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if things get really bad, try hiding inside one of the empty chests! Snake would be proud of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/3d054d3457d12082e913a9cf6b253ccb.poster.avif?t=1782798511\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/3d054d3457d12082e913a9cf6b253ccb.webm?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/3d054d3457d12082e913a9cf6b253ccb.mp4?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry the gold to the ship and escape with it! Pay tribute to Hel, and use whatever remains to buy useful upgrades and power-ups to make your journey easier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/e7ff165b3fe134d12d48339d5c743f76.poster.avif?t=1782798511\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/e7ff165b3fe134d12d48339d5c743f76.webm?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/e7ff165b3fe134d12d48339d5c743f76.mp4?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vikings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab and throw objects using physics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on a raid across all nine realm! (Two biomes in early access: &quot;Midgard Village&quot; and &quot;Midgard Castle&quot;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of different treasures to steal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and bosses to throw objects at or hide from!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline single player!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valhalla, Vikings, Ragnarok!</strong> It's a co-op game about a band of funny Vikings who must raid villages across all nine realms to pay off their debt to Hel and carve their path to Valhalla!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/1323ab93a040c148746241b2023eaa30.poster.avif?t=1782798511\" width=600 height=170 ><source s