2798511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/ca51998c477c55d2a162e0bfe9dc35d6.mp4?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if things get really bad, try hiding inside one of the empty chests! Snake would be proud of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/3d054d3457d12082e913a9cf6b253ccb.poster.avif?t=1782798511\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/3d054d3457d12082e913a9cf6b253ccb.webm?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/3d054d3457d12082e913a9cf6b253ccb.mp4?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry the gold to the ship and escape with it! Pay tribute to Hel, and use whatever remains to buy useful upgrades and power-ups to make your journey easier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/e7ff165b3fe134d12d48339d5c743f76.poster.avif?t=1782798511\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/e7ff165b3fe134d12d48339d5c743f76.webm?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/extras/e7ff165b3fe134d12d48339d5c743f76.mp4?t=1782798511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vikings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab and throw objects using physics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on a raid across all nine realm! (Two biomes in early access: &quot;Midgard Village&quot; and &quot;Midgard Castle&quot;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of different treasures to steal!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and bosses to throw objects at or hide from!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline single player!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Valhalla, Vikings, Ragnarok! It's a co-op game about a band of funny Vikings who must raid villages across all nine realms to pay off their debt to Hel and carve their path to Valhalla! Grab the treasure and carry it to the ship! Fight off the weak, hide from the strong, and do it all for the loot!", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/a1b0f7b855d96d950c83891836920e8ed9d88a80/header.jpg?t=1782798511", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/03b31b9c1b27ec8c2cbbd4642e02244a38474f03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782798511", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159340/03b31b9c1b27ec8c2cbbd4642e02244a38474f03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782798511", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @ 2.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong>  8  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 or RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:<